    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hunters Estate Agent are delighted to present Apartment 49, Block C, The Malthouse to the market. A highly conveniently located 2-bedroom, top floor apartment situated in this secure development, within close proximity of the new children’s hospital and easily accessible to the city centre by foot and beyond from the nearby LUAS line and plentiful bus routes. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with two double bedrooms, a generous storage cupboard, hot press, family bathroom, living / dining area and fitted kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe property has the benefit of one secure underground car parking space and is situated in one of the most popular locations in South Dublin, enjoying excellent transport links including the LUAS and several bus routes providing ease of access to the city centre and surrounding hinterland.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALLWAY\r\n4.47m x 1.03m\r\nTiled flooring, pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\n4.04m x 2.49m\r\nWood effect laminate flooring, pendant lighting, sliding glass doors to rear balcony.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n2.94m x 2.35m\r\nWood effect laminate flooring, pendant lighting, fitted wardrobes, window to rear balcony.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM\r\n2.42m x 1.65m\r\nFully tiled with recessed ceiling lighting. W.C., wash-hand basin, and bath with shower mixer attachment and glass shower screen. Xpelair ceiling mounted extractor fan and Dimplex wall mounted heater. Wall mounted mirror with vanity light.\r\n\r\nLIVING / DINING ROOM\r\n4.96m x 4.90m (max measurement)\r\nWood effect laminate flooring, pendant lighting, double glazed PVC doors leading to Juliet balcony.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n2.56m x 2.31m (max measurement)\r\nTiled flooring & splashback, below and above counter fitted kitchen units, integrated Candy cooker, extractor hood, Hotpoint induction hob, Nordmende fridge, Leibherr freezer, Vortice ceiling mounted extractor fan, Hotpoint washer / dryer.\r\n\r\nSTORAGE\r\n1.62m x 1.23m\r\nTiled flooring, pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nHOT PRESS\r\n0.78m x 0.72m\r\nHot water tank / Immersion.\r\n\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT COMPANY\r\nRF Property management\r\nUlysses House\r\nFoley Street\r\nDublin 1\r\n\r\nANNUAL SERVICE CHARGE €2,465.00\r\n\r\n\r\nBER DETAILS\r\nBER Rating: C\r\nBER Number:"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSpacious two-bedroom top floor apartment.\r\n•\tSecure development.\r\n•\tOne designated underground car parking space.\r\n•\tApproximately 61 sq. m. / 657 sq. ft. \r\n•\tClose to many local amenities including the new children’s hospital, Rialto Village, The Liberties and City Centre.\r\n•\tEasy access to many transport links including bus services LUAS and train routes at Heuston Station.\r\n•\tElectric heating.\r\n•\tDouble glazing.\r\n•\tWell maintained development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "FLOOR PLANS\r\nFor identification purposes only.  Not to scale.\r\n\r\nVIEWING\r\nStrictly by prior appointment through Hunters Estate Agent City Centre on 01 668 0008. Email: city@huntersestateagent.ie\r\n\r\nNo information, statement, description, quantity or measurement contained in any sales particulars or given orally or contained in any webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report, docket or hand out issued by or on behalf of Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor in respect of the property shall constitute a representation or a condition or a warranty on behalf of Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor. Any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis-description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all of the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by Hunters Estate Agents or the vendor as to their operability or efficiency."
      }
